IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0030.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    05 LOAN-TO-VALUE      PIC 9(3).
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(6).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 MI-REQUIRED        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 MI-REQUIRED-2 VALUE 'Y'.
    05 RATE-ADJ           PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM 3000-LTV-RULES
    DISPLAY "MI-REQUIRED=" MI-REQUIRED
    DISPLAY "RATE-ADJ=" RATE-ADJ
    STOP RUN.
3000-LTV-RULES.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 1996
    *>  IF LOAN-TO-VALUE > 64
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF LOAN-TO-VALUE > 80
        SET MI-REQUIRED-2 TO TRUE
        MOVE 0.0025 TO RATE-ADJ
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO MI-REQUIRED
    END-IF.
